## chat.css - Chat Component Stylesheet

**Location**: `wwwroot/css/chat.css`  
**Assembly**: `Cyrena.Components.Runtime`

### Purpose
Provides CSS styles for the Chat.razor component, including chat bubble styling, auto-growing textarea, and border utilities.

### Styles

#### .chat-bubble

Base styling for chat message bubbles:

```css
.chat-bubble {
    max-width: 80%;
    word-wrap: break-word;
}
```

| Property | Value | Description |
|----------|-------|-------------|
| `max-width` | `80%` | Bubbles occupy at most 80% of container width |
| `word-wrap` | `break-word` | Long words break to prevent overflow |

#### .chat-bubble-user

User message bubble styling:

```css
.chat-bubble-user {
    background-color: var(--mud-palette-primary);
    color: var(--mud-palette-primary-text);
}
```

Uses MudBlazor CSS variables for theming:
- Background: Primary palette color
- Text: Primary text color (automatically contrasting)

#### .chat-bubble-assistant

Assistant message bubble styling:

```css
.chat-bubble-assistant {
    background-color: var(--mud-palette-surface);
    color: var(--mud-palette-text-primary);
}
```

Uses MudBlazor CSS variables for theming:
- Background: Surface color
- Text: Primary text color

#### .chat-bubble-has-items

Modifier for bubbles containing file attachments:

```css
.chat-bubble-has-items {
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
}
```

Adds extra top padding when file attachment pills are present above the message content.

#### .auto-grow

Auto-growing textarea styling for the chat composer:

```css
.auto-grow {
    resize: none;
    overflow: hidden;
    min-height: 38px;
    width: 100%;
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    outline: none;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: inherit;
}
```

| Property | Value | Description |
|----------|-------|-------------|
| `resize` | `none` | Disables manual resizing |
| `overflow` | `hidden` | Hides scrollbars |
| `min-height` | `38px` | Minimum height for single line |
| `width` | `100%` | Full width of container |
| `background` | `transparent` | No background color |
| `border` | `none` | No border |
| `outline` | `none` | No focus outline |

#### .border-t

Top border utility:

```css
.border-t {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--mud-palette-divider);
}
```

Uses MudBlazor divider color for consistent theming.

### MudBlazor Integration

All color references use MudBlazor CSS custom properties:

| Variable | Usage |
|----------|-------|
| `--mud-palette-primary` | User bubble background |
| `--mud-palette-primary-text` | User bubble text |
| `--mud-palette-surface` | Assistant bubble background |
| `--mud-palette-text-primary` | Assistant bubble text |
| `--mud-palette-divider` | Border color |

### Related
- `Chat.razor` - Component that uses these styles
